                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I originally bought this on the Wii U and one feature that was missing there (but is here and in the PS4 version) is the connectivity to Twitch, Mixer and YouTube.\n\nLet me just say first of all. This is great fun with friends and family and works as a brilliant couch-play / party game.\n\nBut for me, the real fun is being able to stream it. Casually making a fool of yourself is what the internet is all about and I'm pleased to say that I had a great first stream with this. The viewers were engaged and having a good time, and playing the game is easy, easy, easy.\n\nThe variety of clues and modes (acting it out, singing, describing and drawing) means that the game doesn't get stale - and as the host you get to set the rules, how many points people need to win etc.\n\nIt has a friendly, charming interface and is a lot of fun.\n\nThink of it this way - you'd probably spend as much for this game if not more buying a board game such as Pictionary or Articulate. My tip? Save yourself the hassle and money and have a lot more fun with Act It Out! XL instead.",
